        "collapsible_tab_rmVpDh": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p><strong>Breescape. Built to sleep through.</strong></p><p>Experience all-night relief with a bundle that cools where it counts. Both the comforter and cooling eye mask are powered by our patented BlendTek™ technology—delivering instant coolness, breathable softness, and moisture-wicking comfort from head to toe.</p><p></p><p><strong>Dual-Sided Comfort</strong></p><p>Same materials for our comforter and cooling eye mask:</p><ul><li>Cool Side: 69% Nylon, 20% Polyester, 11% Spandex</li><li>Breathable Side: 58% Eco-Cosy® Viscose, 42% Nylon</li><li>Fill: 30% Naia™ Acetate, 70% Polyester</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>More Comfort</strong></p><p>Every comforter size—from Twin to King—is up to 13.8% larger than standard, providing full coverage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Secure, Light-Blocking Fit</strong></p><p>The cooling eye mask features an adjustable strap and ergonomic shape that stays in place—no slipping, no pressure, and no light getting in.</p><p></p><p><strong>Gentle on Skin</strong></p><p>OEKO-TEX® certified (Certificate No. SH025 256533) for safe, skin-friendly comfort — ideal even for the most sensitive skin.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "<style>\n    .details__content ul{        margin-block: var(--sp-2);}\n    </style>",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        },
